.TH HOSHI 1
.SH NAME
hoshi \- terminal space strategy
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B hoshi
[flags] [command] [arguments]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Bare hoshi opens the title screen. Help never opens a save.
.SH COMMANDS
.SS advise
Read suggestions without taking actions.
.PP
Uses the selected save and the same core rules as interactive play. Results use the versioned JSON envelope. A refused action does not bypass prerequisites or fair\-play restrictions.
.PP
.nf
hoshi advise
.fi
.PP
Example:
.nf
hoshi advise
.fi
.PP
