Environment: None required. See the global environment reference below.
.SH FLAGS
.TP
.B \-\-offline
Disable automatic network requests.
.TP
.B \-\-update\-check
Opt in to background release checks for serve.
.TP
.B \-\-help
Human help (\-h also works).
.TP
.B \-\-version
Build version (\-V also works).
.TP
.B \-\-save PATH
Select a save.
.TP
.B \-\-balance PATH
Override balance configuration.
.TP
.B \-\-seed SEED
Initialize a deterministic harness or new\-game seed.
.TP
.B \-\-continue
Continue the current interactive slot.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-portraits
Use ASCII portraits.
.TP
.B \-\-commentary
Enable replay commentary.
.TP
.B \-\-advisor
Enable optional local advice.
.TP
.B \-\-json
Explicit JSON CLI mode.
.TP
.B \-\-arena
Opt in to the bot arena.
.TP
.B \-\-self\-play
Opt in to balance self\-play.
.TP
.B \-\-demo
Opt in to the governance demonstration.
.TP
.B \-\-bind ADDRESS:PORT
Server listen address (serve only).
.TP
.B \-\-config DIR
Server configuration directory (serve only).
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B HOSHI_LOG
Diagnostic log level: error, warn, info or debug.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_ADMIN_TOKEN
Save\-scoped admin secret for local support reports.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SAVE
Save path when \-\-save is absent.
.TP
.B HOSHI_BALANCE
Balance configuration path when \-\-balance is absent.
.TP
.B HOSHI_BUILD
Build\-time version annotation.
.TP
.B HOSHI_PORTRAIT_PROTOCOL
Portrait protocol selection.
.TP
.B NO_COLOR
Disable terminal colors.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_TOKEN
Runtime bearer token for the selected save.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_TOKEN_FILE
Read the runtime bearer token from this file.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_PUSH
Enable optional web push.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_PUSH_ENDPOINT
Override the opt\-in push endpoint.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_VAPID_PRIVATE
Runtime push signing key; never stored in the save.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_VAPID_SUBJECT
Push contact subject.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_OIDC
Enable optional identity login.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_OIDC_ISSUER
Identity issuer.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_OIDC_CLIENT_ID
Identity client identifier.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_OIDC_AUTHORIZATION
Identity authorization endpoint.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SERVE_OIDC_TOKEN
Identity token endpoint.
.TP
.B HOSHI_VERSION
Install script version selection.
.TP
.B HOSHI_CHANNEL
Install script channel selection.
.TP
.B HOSHI_OFFLINE
Suppress automatic network requests.
.TP
.B HOSHI_SKIP_VERSION_CHECK
Suppress automatic network requests.
.SH EXIT STATUS
0 success; 2 invalid input; 3 action refused; 4 save locked; 5 internal or save error.
